#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:183
msgid "custom node truncate strategy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:184
msgid ""
"In complex html string, you may want to keep some special elements and "
"truncate the others. You can use `customNodeStrategy` to achieve this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:185
msgid "return `'remove'` to remove the node"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:186
msgid ""
"`keep` to keep the node(and anything inside it) anyway, and won't be "
"counted as there is no text content in it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:187
msgid ""
