msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:221
msgid "About final string length"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:223
msgid ""
"If the html string content's length is shorter than `options.length`, "
"then no ellipsis will be appended to the final html string. If longer, "
"then the final string length will be `options.length` + "
"`options.ellipsis`. And if you set `reserveLastWord` to true or none zero"
" number or using `customNodeStrategy`, the final string will be various."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:225
msgid "About html comments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:227
msgid "All html comments `<!-- xxx -->` will be removed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:229
msgid "About dealing with none alphabetic languages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:231
msgid ""
"When dealing with none alphabetic languages, such as "
"Chinese/Japanese/Korean, they don't separate words with whitespaces, so "
"options `byWords` and `reserveLastWord` should only works well with "
"alphabetic languages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/truncate-html_readme.md:233
msgid ""
"And the only dependency of this project `cheerio` has an issue when "
"dealing with none alphabetic languages, see [Known Issues](#known-issues)"
" for details."
msgstr ""

